{
  "Comment": "Caso c05 — pipeline por documento (Standard: waitForTaskToken solo existe en Standard; una revisión puede durar días y Express dura máximo 5 min). Cada etapa automática es un mensaje con task token a la cola doc-tasks; los pods doc-worker lo procesan y responden con SendTaskSuccess/SendTaskFailure. Las URLs de las colas son de ejemplo (cuenta 123456789012): el IaC las sustituye.",
  "QueryLanguage": "JSONPath",
  "StartAt": "Init",
  "States": {
    "Init": {
      "Type": "Pass",
      "Comment": "Contrato del input (lo arma docs-api: solo referencias a S3, nunca bytes) + valores por defecto. Toda ruta que un estado lea con .$ debe existir siempre: review nace en null para que Commit funcione también en el camino STP (una ruta inexistente es un error de runtime). sat_mode=required: la factura se valida contra el SAT; SatUnverified lo cambia a skip.",
      "Parameters": {
        "document_id.$": "$.document_id",
        "application_id.$": "$.application_id",
        "declared_type.$": "$.declared_type",
        "sha256.$": "$.sha256",
        "pages.$": "$.pages",
        "received_at.$": "$.received_at",
        "opts": {
          "sat_mode": "required"
        },
        "review": null
      },
      "Next": "Classify"
    },
    "Classify": {
      "Type": "Task",
      "Comment": "Tipo de documento y rol de cada página (modelo chico en CPU, en los pods doc-worker). Devuelve doc_type y text_source: xml | text_layer | ocr | manual.",
      "Resource": "arn:aws:states:::sqs:sendMessage.waitForTaskToken",
      "Parameters": {
        "QueueUrl": "https://sqs.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/123456789012/doc-tasks",
        "MessageBody": {
          "stage": "classify",
          "task_token.$": "$$.Task.Token",
          "execution.$": "$$.Execution.Id",
          "attempt.$": "$$.State.RetryCount",
          "document_id.$": "$.document_id",
          "declared_type.$": "$.declared_type",
          "pages.$": "$.pages"
        }
      },
      "TimeoutSeconds": 3600,
      "ResultPath": "$.classify",
      "Retry": [
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "Doc.Unreadable",
            "Doc.InvalidInput"
          ],
          "MaxAttempts": 0
        },
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "States.Timeout"
          ],
          "IntervalSeconds": 30,
          "MaxAttempts": 1,
          "BackoffRate": 2.0
        },
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "States.TaskFailed"
          ],
          "IntervalSeconds": 2,
          "MaxAttempts": 4,
          "BackoffRate": 2.0,
          "MaxDelaySeconds": 60,
          "JitterStrategy": "FULL"
        }
      ],
      "Catch": [
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "States.DataLimitExceeded"
          ],
          "ResultPath": "$.error",
          "Next": "ToManualCapture"
        },
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "States.ALL"
          ],
          "ResultPath": "$.error",
          "Next": "ToManualCapture"
        }
      ],
      "Next": "AcquireText"
    },
    "AcquireText": {
      "Type": "Choice",
      "Comment": "El mejor modelo es el que no corres: XML del CFDI > capa de texto del PDF > OCR. Default = OCR (lee cualquier cosa); sin Default, un valor inesperado sería States.NoChoiceMatched y la ejecución fallaría.",
      "Choices": [
        {
          "Variable": "$.classify.text_source",
          "StringEquals": "xml",
          "Next": "ReadCfdiXml"
        },
        {
          "Variable": "$.classify.text_source",
          "StringEquals": "text_layer",
          "Next": "ReadTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "Variable": "$.classify.text_source",
          "StringEquals": "manual",
          "Next": "ToManualCapture"
        }
      ],
      "Default": "RunOcr"
    },
    "ReadCfdiXml": {
      "Type": "Task",
      "Comment": "pipeline/cfdi.py: parsea el XML y devuelve los campos con confidence 1.0 (mismo esquema que Extract). Salta Extract: no hay nada que adivinar.",
      "Resource": "arn:aws:states:::sqs:sendMessage.waitForTaskToken",
      "Parameters": {
        "QueueUrl": "https://sqs.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/123456789012/doc-tasks",
        "MessageBody": {
          "stage": "read_xml",
          "task_token.$": "$$.Task.Token",
          "execution.$": "$$.Execution.Id",
          "attempt.$": "$$.State.RetryCount",
          "document_id.$": "$.document_id",
          "pages.$": "$.pages"
        }
      },
      "TimeoutSeconds": 3600,
      "ResultPath": "$.extract",
      "Retry": [
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "Doc.Unreadable",
            "Doc.InvalidInput"
          ],
          "MaxAttempts": 0
        },
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "States.Timeout"
          ],
          "IntervalSeconds": 30,
          "MaxAttempts": 1,
          "BackoffRate": 2.0
        },
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "States.TaskFailed"
          ],
          "IntervalSeconds": 2,
          "MaxAttempts": 4,
          "BackoffRate": 2.0,
          "MaxDelaySeconds": 60,
          "JitterStrategy": "FULL"
        }
      ],
      "Catch": [
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "States.DataLimitExceeded"
          ],
          "ResultPath": "$.error",
          "Next": "ToManualCapture"
        },
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "States.ALL"
          ],
          "ResultPath": "$.error",
          "Next": "ToManualCapture"
        }
      ],
      "Next": "Validate"
    },
    "ReadTextLayer": {
      "Type": "Task",
      "Comment": "PDF nacido digital: palabras y cajas de la capa de texto (sin OCR, sin costo por página). El texto completo va a S3; aquí vuelve solo su llave.",
      "Resource": "arn:aws:states:::sqs:sendMessage.waitForTaskToken",
      "Parameters": {
        "QueueUrl": "https://sqs.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/123456789012/doc-tasks",
        "MessageBody": {
          "stage": "read_text_layer",
          "task_token.$": "$$.Task.Token",
          "execution.$": "$$.Execution.Id",
          "attempt.$": "$$.State.RetryCount",
          "document_id.$": "$.document_id",
          "pages.$": "$.pages"
        }
      },
      "TimeoutSeconds": 3600,
      "ResultPath": "$.text",
      "Retry": [
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "Doc.Unreadable",
            "Doc.InvalidInput"
          ],
          "MaxAttempts": 0
        },
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "States.Timeout"
          ],
          "IntervalSeconds": 30,
          "MaxAttempts": 1,
          "BackoffRate": 2.0
        },
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "States.TaskFailed"
          ],
          "IntervalSeconds": 2,
          "MaxAttempts": 4,
          "BackoffRate": 2.0,
          "MaxDelaySeconds": 60,
          "JitterStrategy": "FULL"
        }
      ],
      "Catch": [
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "States.DataLimitExceeded"
          ],
          "ResultPath": "$.error",
          "Next": "ToManualCapture"
        },
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "States.ALL"
          ],
          "ResultPath": "$.error",
          "Next": "ToManualCapture"
        }
      ],
      "Next": "Extract"
    },
    "RunOcr": {
      "Type": "Task",
      "Comment": "OCR administrado (DetectDocumentText, página por página): palabras + cajas + confianza 0-100 + TextType (PRINTED/HANDWRITING). El JSON va a S3; el estado solo lleva la llave (límite de 256 KiB).",
      "Resource": "arn:aws:states:::sqs:sendMessage.waitForTaskToken",
      "Parameters": {
        "QueueUrl": "https://sqs.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/123456789012/doc-tasks",
        "MessageBody": {
          "stage": "ocr",
          "task_token.$": "$$.Task.Token",
          "execution.$": "$$.Execution.Id",
          "attempt.$": "$$.State.RetryCount",
          "document_id.$": "$.document_id",
          "pages.$": "$.pages"
        }
      },
      "TimeoutSeconds": 3600,
      "ResultPath": "$.text",
      "Retry": [
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "Doc.Unreadable",
            "Doc.InvalidInput"
          ],
          "MaxAttempts": 0
        },
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "Ocr.Throttled"
          ],
          "IntervalSeconds": 2,
          "MaxAttempts": 6,
          "BackoffRate": 2.0,
          "MaxDelaySeconds": 60,
          "JitterStrategy": "FULL"
        },
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "States.Timeout"
          ],
          "IntervalSeconds": 30,
          "MaxAttempts": 1,
          "BackoffRate": 2.0
        },
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "States.TaskFailed"
          ],
          "IntervalSeconds": 2,
          "MaxAttempts": 4,
          "BackoffRate": 2.0,
          "MaxDelaySeconds": 60,
          "JitterStrategy": "FULL"
        }
      ],
      "Catch": [
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "States.DataLimitExceeded"
          ],
          "ResultPath": "$.error",
          "Next": "ToManualCapture"
        },
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "States.ALL"
          ],
          "ResultPath": "$.error",
          "Next": "ToManualCapture"
        }
      ],
      "Next": "Extract"
    },
    "Extract": {
      "Type": "Task",
      "Comment": "Modelo layout-aware (ONNX Runtime en CPU) + reglas/regex por tipo de documento. Devuelve fields: {nombre: {value, confidence calibrada, source, page, bbox}}.",
      "Resource": "arn:aws:states:::sqs:sendMessage.waitForTaskToken",
      "Parameters": {
        "QueueUrl": "https://sqs.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/123456789012/doc-tasks",
        "MessageBody": {
          "stage": "extract",
          "task_token.$": "$$.Task.Token",
          "execution.$": "$$.Execution.Id",
          "attempt.$": "$$.State.RetryCount",
          "document_id.$": "$.document_id",
          "doc_type.$": "$.classify.doc_type",
          "text.$": "$.text"
        }
      },
      "TimeoutSeconds": 3600,
      "ResultPath": "$.extract",
      "Retry": [
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "Doc.Unreadable",
            "Doc.InvalidInput"
          ],
          "MaxAttempts": 0
        },
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "States.Timeout"
          ],
          "IntervalSeconds": 30,
          "MaxAttempts": 1,
          "BackoffRate": 2.0
        },
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "States.TaskFailed"
          ],
          "IntervalSeconds": 2,
          "MaxAttempts": 4,
          "BackoffRate": 2.0,
          "MaxDelaySeconds": 60,
          "JitterStrategy": "FULL"
        }
      ],
      "Catch": [
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "States.DataLimitExceeded"
          ],
          "ResultPath": "$.error",
          "Next": "ToManualCapture"
        },
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "States.ALL"
          ],
          "ResultPath": "$.error",
          "Next": "ToManualCapture"
        }
      ],
      "Next": "Validate"
    },
    "Validate": {
      "Type": "Task",
      "Comment": "pipeline/validators.py + cruces entre documentos + estatus del CFDI en el SAT. Si el SAT no responde: 3 reintentos (30, 60, 120 s con jitter) y luego SatUnverified.",
      "Resource": "arn:aws:states:::sqs:sendMessage.waitForTaskToken",
      "Parameters": {
        "QueueUrl": "https://sqs.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/123456789012/doc-tasks",
        "MessageBody": {
          "stage": "validate",
          "task_token.$": "$$.Task.Token",
          "execution.$": "$$.Execution.Id",
          "attempt.$": "$$.State.RetryCount",
          "document_id.$": "$.document_id",
          "doc_type.$": "$.classify.doc_type",
          "application_id.$": "$.application_id",
          "fields.$": "$.extract.fields",
          "sat_mode.$": "$.opts.sat_mode"
        }
      },
      "TimeoutSeconds": 900,
      "ResultPath": "$.validation",
      "Retry": [
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "Doc.Unreadable",
            "Doc.InvalidInput"
          ],
          "MaxAttempts": 0
        },
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "Sat.Unavailable"
          ],
          "IntervalSeconds": 30,
          "MaxAttempts": 3,
          "BackoffRate": 2.0,
          "JitterStrategy": "FULL"
        },
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "States.Timeout"
          ],
          "IntervalSeconds": 30,
          "MaxAttempts": 1,
          "BackoffRate": 2.0
        },
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "States.TaskFailed"
          ],
          "IntervalSeconds": 2,
          "MaxAttempts": 4,
          "BackoffRate": 2.0,
          "MaxDelaySeconds": 60,
          "JitterStrategy": "FULL"
        }
      ],
      "Catch": [
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "Sat.Unavailable"
          ],
          "ResultPath": "$.sat_error",
          "Next": "SatUnverified"
        },
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "States.DataLimitExceeded"
          ],
          "ResultPath": "$.error",
          "Next": "ToManualCapture"
        },
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "States.ALL"
          ],
          "ResultPath": "$.error",
          "Next": "ToManualCapture"
        }
      ],
      "Next": "Route"
    },
    "SatUnverified": {
      "Type": "Pass",
      "Comment": "Degradación: sin SAT, la factura no puede ser STP (la regla sat_estatus falla con 'no verificado') y va a revisión con ese motivo. Alternativa a discutir: esperar más (un Wait) y no inundar a los revisores; lo vigila SATValidationDown.",
      "Result": "skip",
      "ResultPath": "$.opts.sat_mode",
      "Next": "Validate"
    },
    "Route": {
      "Type": "Task",
      "Comment": "pipeline/routing.py: STP solo si todos los campos requeridos superan su umbral calibrado y todas las validaciones pasan; si no, tarea de revisión con SOLO los campos marcados.",
      "Resource": "arn:aws:states:::sqs:sendMessage.waitForTaskToken",
      "Parameters": {
        "QueueUrl": "https://sqs.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/123456789012/doc-tasks",
        "MessageBody": {
          "stage": "route",
          "task_token.$": "$$.Task.Token",
          "execution.$": "$$.Execution.Id",
          "attempt.$": "$$.State.RetryCount",
          "document_id.$": "$.document_id",
          "doc_type.$": "$.classify.doc_type",
          "application_id.$": "$.application_id",
          "received_at.$": "$.received_at",
          "fields.$": "$.extract.fields",
          "validations.$": "$.validation.results"
        }
      },
      "TimeoutSeconds": 600,
      "ResultPath": "$.route",
      "Retry": [
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "Doc.Unreadable",
            "Doc.InvalidInput"
          ],
          "MaxAttempts": 0
        },
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "States.Timeout"
          ],
          "IntervalSeconds": 30,
          "MaxAttempts": 1,
          "BackoffRate": 2.0
        },
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "States.TaskFailed"
          ],
          "IntervalSeconds": 2,
          "MaxAttempts": 4,
          "BackoffRate": 2.0,
          "MaxDelaySeconds": 60,
          "JitterStrategy": "FULL"
        }
      ],
      "Catch": [
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "States.DataLimitExceeded"
          ],
          "ResultPath": "$.error",
          "Next": "ToManualCapture"
        },
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "States.ALL"
          ],
          "ResultPath": "$.error",
          "Next": "ToManualCapture"
        }
      ],
      "Next": "IsStp"
    },
    "IsStp": {
      "Type": "Choice",
      "Choices": [
        {
          "Variable": "$.route.decision",
          "StringEquals": "stp",
          "Next": "Commit"
        },
        {
          "Variable": "$.route.decision",
          "StringEquals": "review",
          "Next": "HumanReview"
        }
      ],
      "Default": "ToManualCapture"
    },
    "HumanReview": {
      "Type": "Task",
      "Comment": "Callback con persona: review-api guarda la tarea (y su token) en Postgres y la ordena por sort_at (SQS no tiene prioridades). Al guardar el revisor, SendTaskSuccess con los campos corregidos. review-api manda SendTaskHeartbeat cada hora por cada tarea abierta: si deja de hacerlo (perdió la tarea), a las 2 h esto falla y el documento no queda colgado 5 días. 5 días de TimeoutSeconds cubren un fin de semana largo.",
      "Resource": "arn:aws:states:::sqs:sendMessage.waitForTaskToken",
      "Parameters": {
        "QueueUrl": "https://sqs.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/123456789012/doc-review",
        "MessageBody": {
          "task_token.$": "$$.Task.Token",
          "execution.$": "$$.Execution.Id",
          "document_id.$": "$.document_id",
          "review_task.$": "$.route.review_task"
        }
      },
      "HeartbeatSeconds": 7200,
      "TimeoutSeconds": 432000,
      "ResultPath": "$.review",
      "Catch": [
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "States.HeartbeatTimeout",
            "States.Timeout"
          ],
          "ResultPath": "$.error",
          "Next": "ToManualCapture"
        },
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "States.DataLimitExceeded"
          ],
          "ResultPath": "$.error",
          "Next": "ToManualCapture"
        },
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "States.ALL"
          ],
          "ResultPath": "$.error",
          "Next": "ToManualCapture"
        }
      ],
      "Next": "Commit"
    },
    "Commit": {
      "Type": "Task",
      "Comment": "Postgres con procedencia por campo (página, bbox, etapa, versión de modelo, confianza, revisor) + envío al core, idempotente por document_id. Reintentos largos: el core puede estar en mantenimiento, y lo revisado no se tira.",
      "Resource": "arn:aws:states:::sqs:sendMessage.waitForTaskToken",
      "Parameters": {
        "QueueUrl": "https://sqs.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/123456789012/doc-tasks",
        "MessageBody": {
          "stage": "commit",
          "task_token.$": "$$.Task.Token",
          "execution.$": "$$.Execution.Id",
          "attempt.$": "$$.State.RetryCount",
          "document_id.$": "$.document_id",
          "route.$": "$.route",
          "fields.$": "$.extract.fields",
          "review.$": "$.review"
        }
      },
      "TimeoutSeconds": 900,
      "ResultPath": "$.commit",
      "Retry": [
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "Doc.Unreadable",
            "Doc.InvalidInput"
          ],
          "MaxAttempts": 0
        },
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "States.Timeout"
          ],
          "IntervalSeconds": 30,
          "MaxAttempts": 1,
          "BackoffRate": 2.0
        },
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "States.TaskFailed"
          ],
          "IntervalSeconds": 5,
          "MaxAttempts": 6,
          "BackoffRate": 2.0,
          "MaxDelaySeconds": 300,
          "JitterStrategy": "FULL"
        }
      ],
      "Catch": [
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "States.DataLimitExceeded"
          ],
          "ResultPath": "$.error",
          "Next": "ToManualCapture"
        },
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "States.ALL"
          ],
          "ResultPath": "$.error",
          "Next": "ToManualCapture"
        }
      ],
      "Next": "Done"
    },
    "Done": {
      "Type": "Succeed"
    },
    "ToManualCapture": {
      "Type": "Task",
      "Comment": "Último recurso, nunca perder un documento: el estado completo (llaves de S3, lo extraído, lo revisado y el error) va a la cola de captura manual, con reintentos generosos. Request-response: no espera a nadie.",
      "Resource": "arn:aws:states:::sqs:sendMessage",
      "Parameters": {
        "QueueUrl": "https://sqs.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/123456789012/doc-manual-capture",
        "MessageBody": {
          "document_id.$": "$.document_id",
          "execution.$": "$$.Execution.Id",
          "state.$": "$"
        }
      },
      "ResultPath": null,
      "Retry": [
        {
          "ErrorEquals": [
            "States.ALL"
          ],
          "IntervalSeconds": 5,
          "MaxAttempts": 10,
          "BackoffRate": 2.0,
          "MaxDelaySeconds": 300,
          "JitterStrategy": "FULL"
        }
      ],
      "Next": "SentToManualCapture"
    },
    "SentToManualCapture": {
      "Type": "Fail",
      "Error": "Doc.ManualCapture",
      "Cause": "El documento no terminó en automático ni en revisión; quedó en doc-manual-capture. Termina en Fail a propósito: ExecutionsFailed lo cuenta."
    }
  }
}
